-- The List `andThen` (flatMap/concatMap) is an accumulator loop whose every
-- recursive call is a tail call, so stack depth is constant in both the outer
-- list length and the per-element result size.  Here the outer list is 200000
-- long but each element contributes an EMPTY list except the first, so the
-- result is just [42], length 1.  The small result keeps the (separately
-- non-tail) `length`/`fold` off the deep path, so this fixture isolates the
-- andThen loop.
main =
  println (length (flatMap (x => if x == 1 then [42] else []) [1..=200000]))
